{
  "_about": "Deck photo registry — the single source of truth for the photographs used across the decks. sync-assets.mjs fills the <!-- PHOTO:START <id> --> markers in slides from this; build.mjs runs it automatically. SOURCE photos live in deck-system/assets/images/<section>/ (curated, web-safe names); sync-images.mjs (run by build.mjs) copies them into public/img/shared/services/<section>/ — a deck-only folder, kept separate from the website's own assets elsewhere in public. To swap a photo: replace the file in assets/images/<section>/ keeping the same name, then rebuild — it cascades to every slide and deck using that id. To add a photo: drop it in assets/images/<section>/, register it here, reference its id from a slide marker. `id` convention is <section>-<name>; `file` is the deck-only public path. `placeholder:true` marks a slot whose final photo hasn't landed yet.",
